      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "The harness is application code; the desktop provider supplies computer controls.\nUse scripts / APIs for precise edits and computer use when the graphical interface is needed.\nA failed check returns evidence for repair. Tests do not get weakened to make a run pass.",
