      "text": "If PCB v3 becomes v4: invalidate dependent enclosure, fit checks, renders and launch assets.\nRebuild only what changed. The revision gate releases the package once the dependencies agree.\nValidator agents interpret evidence; deterministic checks establish the defined pass/fail results.",
